            "pairing_rejected": "The machine refused the pairing request. This usually means the Connect dialog never appeared — check that the machine is powered on and reachable.",
            "wrong_pin": "The machine requires a PIN, or the PIN you provided is wrong. Go back to manual setup and enter the correct PIN.",
            "wrong_hash": "The stored credentials are no longer valid. Remove and re-add the integration to re-pair.",
